      <description>Ice Watch 0.4.5

- Preferences opens inside the existing panel, with a Back button and no sheet animation.
- Product history appears as a table at the bottom of Preferences, with hover highlights and Watch actions.
- Keeps the 20 most recent products. Switching back checks the current price and uses it as the alert target.
</description>
