    <item>
      <title>0.4.3</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 06:18:30 -0400</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>14</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
      <enclosure url="https://www.campbell17.com/apps/ice-watch/IceWatch-14.zip" length="1536791" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="kF1X7Nsu4vdmNtukDsUPFg1DCboq0JCQAFcpCM5ljGcilq5I+QRr2CtuSBHezzLVzAmUdrhhfBzITRRW2GO7CA==" />
      <description>Ice Watch 0.4.3

- Local offers now show a nearby store address and distance, with a 10-mile search radius.
- Purchase minimums appear beneath the main price. Multipack prices are calculated per bottle.
- View deal sits beside the price; the alert-price control is now in Preferences.
- Sale dates are visible, header icons are smaller, and the price list has less bottom spacing with no trailing divider.
</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>0.4.2</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:42:05 -0400</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>13</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
