      <description>Ice Watch 0.4.2

- Updated interface with compact controls, a price slider and a light/dark toggle.
- Change the tracked product by entering a product URL.
- Clearer labels and instructions throughout the app.
- The alert price stays unselected when the panel opens.
- New snowflake icon and signed, Apple-notarized installer.

Requires Apple silicon and macOS 14 or later.
</description>
    </item>
